{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold on in the Dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>&quot;Hold on in the Dungeons&quot;</strong> is a 2D action-simulation game where you build and develop a team to clear dungeons. Strategize well and assemble the best team to achieve victory in challenging dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Building</strong> \u2013 Form and develop a team with characters that have distinct abilities and skills. Create the perfect synergy and optimize your strategy to clear dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Abilities &amp; Customization</strong> \u2013 Each character can be customized with unique skill builds, allowing for a wide range of strategic playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Survival\u00a0</strong>\u2013Experience a challenging gameplay based on survival mechanics. Make the right decisions to strengthen your characters, withstand enemy waves, and lead your team to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Character Classes</strong> \u2013 Choose from <strong>6 different character classes</strong>, each fitting into <strong>one of three combat styles</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee:</strong> Warrior, Assassin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Half-Range:</strong> Spellblade, Elementalist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-Range:</strong> Wizard, Hunter</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Each character may possess a unique and distinctive sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":